        "description": "Simulates scanning the QR code. The amount comes from the order, not from the body. Expected: 200, message 'Payment completed successfully', status paid, paid_at set, invoice_number like INV-YYYYMMDD-000042, expires_at and seconds_left null, target { type food_order, id }, order_status pending (food orders still wait for the admin).",
